    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target>
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">- 110 of law graduates from marginalized communities to empower women, Dalit, PWD, LGBTIQ+ and other marginalized communities with targeted interventions
- 8 draft bills drafted for the province governments in Nepal
- 150,000 (33% women) persons benefited from legal aid services in four provinces
- One study on access to justice of women and marginalized groups conducted
- Around 100 officials of province government trained on law making process 
- Around 200 officials of judicial committees under local bodies trained on their roles/responsibilities and process/procedures of dispute settlement
